From: serpent-wrt packaging <noreply@example.com>
Subject: go.mod: use OpenWrt 25.12 Go toolchain level

OpenWrt 25.12.4 ships Go 1.26.2 in the packages feed. The v0.3.1 upstream
release tarball declares Go 1.26.3, which is newer than the release SDK's Go
toolchain. Keep the package source pinned to the immutable release tarball and
patch only the module language version during OpenWrt package builds.

--- a/go.mod
+++ b/go.mod
@@ -3 +3 @@
-go 1.26.3
+go 1.26.2
